    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d20">

                <pb facs="0046" n="28" sameAs="frus:frus1946v01/pg28"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB/4–2046</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stettinius</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-04-22">April 22, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Ed</hi>: I have been giving thought to the
                    question of the organization and operation of our mission to the United Nations
                    as a result of our various talks on this subject and conversations I have had
                    recently with Mr. Winant.</p>
                <p>It seems to me that it is important that this matter be clarified. Accordingly, I
                    am sending you the attached memorandum on that subject as expressive of my
                        views.<anchor n="53" xml:id="d20-f1"/> I would appreciate it if you would
                    bring this study to Mr. Winant’s attention when he arrives in New York.</p>
                <p>I will of course be glad to have any comments which occur either to you or to Mr.
                    Winant on this subject and I recognize that the whole question must be subject
                    to developments as we gather experience in this field.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>[<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> F. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
